# SHARD WAL Test Data Manifest — multi-page B-tree variant
# Database: places_wal_multi_page.db
# Created by: create_places_wal_multi_page.py
# Created: 2026-08-07
#
# 100 rows force a B-tree page split so moz_places spans an interior root
# (page 2) plus two leaf pages (page 3: rows 1-85, page 4: rows 86-100).
# Deletions from both leaf pages verify SHARD can correlate non-root leaf
# WAL frames to the correct table.  SQLite rebalanced the B-tree after the
# second delete, but recovery still succeeds from the pre-deletion snapshots.
# All three files were captured as-is after SIGKILL with no SQLite cleanup.

